  <view class="ar-row"><view class="ar-ic">尺</view><view class="ar-tx"><text style="font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e">三值体系：</text>共济值（生存权·按需）/ 贡献值CV（发展权·按劳）/ 负贡献值（追责·修复）。</view></view>
  <view class="ar-row"><view class="ar-ic">阶</view><view class="ar-tx"><text style="font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e">当前阶段：</text>规则先于开放，单机策划阶段。彬州试点仅为<text style="font-weight:700;color:#c41e3a">策划方案</text>，从未真正实施。</view></view>
</view>

